        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat storage 2000l, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat storage 2000l, at plant
Production of a chrome steel tank including heat exchanger and boiler. ;
UUID: 5efdfbfc-b4c5-3444-8311-55dd455506dd
Production and disposal of a heat storage. Including materials and energy use of production.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: Heat storage with a capacity of 2000l for use in a solar collector heating system.
Time period: Materials investigated in 2002. Energy use investigated for the year 2001.
Production volume: Production volume 1000 units per year. Total production in CH not known.
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: Data of one factory used for CH. Energy use extrapolated by weight for 2000l storage.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5efdfbfc-b4c5-3444-8311-55dd455506dd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
